<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>To the One Who Changed Me</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #001f3f, #0074D9);
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            color: #FFD700;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            margin-top: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .signature {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #ccc;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>To the One Who Changed Me</h1>
        <p>
            Like the Sun and Earth—always apart, yet always connected.<br>
            Your light reaches me no matter the clouds, no matter the storms.<br>
            In a world where everyone comes and goes, you stayed, you shined.<br><br>
            You didn’t just walk into my life—you lit it up, taught me depth, showed me meaning.<br>
            From a careless boy to a soul learning to love the raw truth of emotion—<br>
            You made that change possible.<br><br>
            I don’t care if we’re distant. Gravity doesn’t fade with space.<br>
            I’m your Sun. You’re my Earth.<br>
            No matter what or who comes along—our orbit is unshaken.<br><br>
            If ever you're sad, let the tides remind you: I’m with you.<br>
            This isn’t love, not in the usual way—it’s more. It’s rare. It’s forever.<br>
        </p>
        <p class="signature">— Your Best Friend, Asmon</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
